{"data":[{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1915437977322631346","created_at":"2025-04-24T16:09:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1915437977322631346"],"id":"1915437977322631346","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":33951,"like_count":226,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"text":"你罕见地想和他在做爱的时候玩一下角色互换。\n于是他骑在你身上，狠狠地坐奸你。\n动情的时候，他揉着自己的奶子，说被主人的几把插坏了。\n你一巴掌打在他脸上。质问他平时自己是这样的吗。\n他的神志短暂地清明了一瞬。\n然后掐住你的脖子，更大力地坐下去。\n“坐死你，小骚鸡巴。”\n“宝宝主人爽不爽？”","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1915437977322631346"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1908699671788429582","created_at":"2025-04-06T01:53:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1908699671788429582"],"id":"1908699671788429582","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":34,"impression_count":63035,"like_count":403,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":9},"text":"你最喜欢的做爱姿势是女上。\n有时是掐着他的脖子，有时是扽紧它脖子上的项圈。\n他的精液会在窒息边缘，射进你的小穴深处。\n你俯下身，扇着他的脸，让他求你。\n这种时候，他的眼睛也被红血丝侵占。\n低哑着嗓音，求你：\n主人，求你让我把你逼里的精液舔干净。\n求你…在我脸上喷出来。\n小狗会都喝下去的。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1908699671788429582"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1901648709693342153","created_at":"2025-03-17T14:55:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1901648709693342153"],"id":"1901648709693342153","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":105140,"like_count":724,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":11},"text":"#奶子的高故事性黄色激情短打 \n温馨睡前小故事一则😋 https://t.co/TH21ewz9XB","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1901648709693342153"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1894404206448316520","created_at":"2025-02-25T15:08:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1894404206448316520"],"id":"1894404206448316520","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":58796,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"十个三星五费很难吗？\n我觉得还好吧 😎（快夸我 https://t.co/YHA2V9YALi","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1894404206448316520"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1889369665551667609","created_at":"2025-02-11T17:43:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1889369665551667609"],"id":"1889369665551667609","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":302206,"like_count":255,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":4},"text":"【清水书信】芸芸某某\n\n“完美无法定义，正如爱，正如你，正如千千万万位自由生长的女性。”\n“没有人是一座孤岛，我是你身边永远不会被海水冲散的礁石。”\n\n（虽然迟到了一周 但让我们再次㊗️我老婆小白菜生日快乐🎊\n#男喘台本 #台本 #清水书信 #喜不喜欢奶子绞尽奶汁的大本子 https://t.co/xR777oPvjO","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1889369665551667609"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1884243335822598279","created_at":"2025-01-28T14:13:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1884243335822598279"],"id":"1884243335822598279","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":48944,"like_count":112,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"宝贝们新年快乐！\n不只新年每天都要快乐！！！","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1884243335822598279"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1883577692811137188","created_at":"2025-01-26T18:08:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1883577692811137188"],"id":"1883577692811137188","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":41,"impression_count":142149,"like_count":869,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":9},"text":"你和他冷战了很久，大概有……八个小时那么久。\n所以你下班回家看到漆黑的客厅时，心里的火气又平添了几分。\n你一边脱鞋，一边在墙上摸索灯的开关。\n直到你摸到了他微微起伏的胸膛。\n你赌气般的将手拿开，却被他猛地攫住手腕。\n然后一阵晕眩，你被他掐住脖子，按在墙上。\n#奶子的高故事性黄色激情短打","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1883577692811137188"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1882459338738196724","created_at":"2025-01-23T16:04:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882459338738196724"],"id":"1882459338738196724","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":87,"impression_count":255163,"like_count":1611,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":46,"retweet_count":32},"text":"他是成熟可靠的叔叔。\n任何一个你们两人同时出现的场合，他都能将你照顾的无微不至，同时也能处理好所有烂桃花。\n你们回到家，门关上的一瞬间。\n他立刻跪在地上，将你的脚放在自己的鸡巴上。\n随着你的力道加重，他的鸡巴逐渐充血。\n粗喘道：\n对不起主人，今天贱狗被别人碰到了肩膀，求你狠狠惩罚贱狗。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1882459338738196724"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1229453490537107457","name":"人间杀爸客（不放授权版","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950068769885462528/Z5noQeeo_normal.jpg","username":"HnrBB2nai","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1915437977322631346","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3frr6t6e72aj3w6n8mnbwx6dru79c3h","oldest_id":"1882459338738196724","result_count":8}}